          >Full write-up</a
        >
        <a href="/research/">Back</a>
      </p>

      <div class="tail">
        <p class="contact">
          <a href="/work/">Full background</a>
          <a href="mailto:hello@francescovigni.com">hello@francescovigni.com</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/francescovigni">GitHub</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
